  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "編者出的這一個題目，範圍實在大得很。",
      "output_sha256": "b406455bd14a8efe4eddbe63c04897cffe0bf566c477cee83433eb86829dc1d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "b406455bd14a8efe4eddbe63c04897cffe0bf566c477cee83433eb86829dc1d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "先自室內旅行起，以至世界旅行，星球、月球旅行等，在實際上，在空想上，二十二年中，大約總有許多人試過的無疑。",
      "output_sha256": "b5f637efbd70daa22274152cd3e44b382ec5ced96a6dc8596ed58ae85f3c648d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "b5f637efbd70daa22274152cd3e44b382ec5ced96a6dc8596ed58ae85f3c648d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "編者把這題目來分給我，想來是因爲我在二十二年秋天，上浙東去旅行過一次的緣故；但這一次旅行的結果，已經爲杭江鐵路局寫了兩篇旅行記──一名《杭江小曆紀程》，一名《浙東景物紀略》──隨時在各報上雜誌上發表過一次，現在已被收入到該局發行的旅行指南里去了。",
      "output_sha256": "51e2c3c1211d5b47b3da1a7f272a88dbb9878c290ed61fc8f49b6c7ad0e56780",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "51e2c3c1211d5b47b3da1a7f272a88dbb9878c290ed61fc8f49b6c7ad0e56780",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "迫不得已，我只好寫點關於旅行一般的空話，以及還有許多在浙東得來的零星印象，來繳卷塞責。",
      "output_sha256": "40b90b3f49e37ad56791c8fb1d77ae2b46531508a399f3f11788204d8a7883fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "40b90b3f49e37ad56791c8fb1d77ae2b46531508a399f3f11788204d8a7883fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "旅行，實在是有間有錢有健康的人的最好的娛樂。",
      "output_sha256": "1c3e7f2591d4b95cb4ae84439906ffcebe028aa20bcb12311bb843c6484727e6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "1c3e7f2591d4b95cb4ae84439906ffcebe028aa20bcb12311bb843c6484727e6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "過去的中國人對出門旅行抱有恐懼，離家百里之前，總要向祖宗禱告，告別親友，彷彿不回來是常態；而如今，飛機、船隻、火車和汽車等交通工具的發展，使得千里萬里皆可瞬間抵達。",
      "output_sha256": "4d9ba3396d347f46e5755f2a2facaf2e61b8928583b9ca97fbd10f1947c3b8d7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.460652,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "898c609709d547d56d1fe7d8930856e4db23d47adae1dbfcb0d07d32efd2a28f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4d9ba3396d347f46e5755f2a2facaf2e61b8928583b9ca97fbd10f1947c3b8d7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因此，昔日人們所畏懼的旅行，現今卻被當作一種娛樂。",
      "output_sha256": "65ab76c83cce72091916847f13de6e2342b7e4ea1fe5125725698a65dcb07f34",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.460652,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "898c609709d547d56d1fe7d8930856e4db23d47adae1dbfcb0d07d32efd2a28f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "65ab76c83cce72091916847f13de6e2342b7e4ea1fe5125725698a65dcb07f34",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有幾個有錢好事的閒人，並且還把它當作了一種學問。",
      "output_sha256": "0956841a135a73813f85ad22a5b053f7b82185aadaa2b28fefccd636281eb6db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "0956841a135a73813f85ad22a5b053f7b82185aadaa2b28fefccd636281eb6db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想旅行的快樂，第一當然是在精神的解放；一個人生在世上，少不得總有種種糾紛和關係纏繞在身邊的，富人有富人的憂慮，窮人有窮人的苦惱，一上征途，則同進了病院和監獄一樣，什麼事情都可以暫時擱起，不管她媽了；──以入病院和進監獄爲譬喻，或者是有點語病，但我所注重的，是在對於人世的雜務一方面的話，入了病院，工總可以不做了，進了監獄，債總可以不還了，是這一個意思。",
      "output_sha256": "ae30b2fe48775f71044d396c1b2bc75be87a7daec6bc9ea4ae80c172dac1b265",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae30b2fe48775f71044d396c1b2bc75be87a7daec6bc9ea4ae80c172dac1b265",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其次，旅行的愉悅大概是在於滿足好奇心。",
      "output_sha256": "80d319cd6a4ff3d4619a2e1b032ff25add2b0cadcc4a2bd7c44f02c937692493",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.424275,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b158b6129d9bd5e32320b166796af7feab7a8f9f72a85af0bc8b433c73e4c8ae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "80d319cd6a4ff3d4619a2e1b032ff25add2b0cadcc4a2bd7c44f02c937692493",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "身邊有一位美麗的女子相伴的男子，與臃腫的女僕之間的親密行為，或許也正是旅行者心中那份對於新奇事物的渴望。",
      "output_sha256": "03dc88535ffe6b11fbcbc672a08b242cee00f9a8dabcfe05d00b589f83ceb999",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.424275,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b158b6129d9bd5e32320b166796af7feab7a8f9f72a85af0bc8b433c73e4c8ae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "03dc88535ffe6b11fbcbc672a08b242cee00f9a8dabcfe05d00b589f83ceb999",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "本來有高大的洋房作住宅的先生們，到了鄉下，看見一所茅草蓋頂，柳樹當門的廁所，會得喜歡叫絕的，也就是這一個Caprice在那裏作怪。",
      "output_sha256": "158bd1962f050b0af3f6c9f19949ec67066249bfd5ca1dbd6a34d13d6a86a980",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "158bd1962f050b0af3f6c9f19949ec67066249bfd5ca1dbd6a34d13d6a86a980",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "還有些人，覺得平時的生活太舒適了，只想去不會喪命的冒些小險，不會損身的吃些小苦，以打破打破那一條生命之流的單條平滑，旅行卻也是最適當的一針嗎啡。",
      "output_sha256": "36abee629dddb59985c21f1fd7fb0d5e699474f2c37cede569def30099a46624",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "36abee629dddb59985c21f1fd7fb0d5e699474f2c37cede569def30099a46624",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "唯其是如此，所以中國也有了同Thos.Cok and son一樣的一個旅行社，蕭伯納也坐飛機飛過了長城，獨身者的奪柯勃辣想在北平市裏破一破獨身之戒。",
      "output_sha256": "665ae534d25a42fd739764ac656675f35bd4fa324aa80b7fd3ebbe0858102e65",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "665ae534d25a42fd739764ac656675f35bd4fa324aa80b7fd3ebbe0858102e65",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "可是，我這次去浙東的旅行，雖然名義上是旅行，實際上卻是在替路局工作，是一名行旅的推銷者。",
      "output_sha256": "3637fffaebdad1ad6d6b7d9d9d863ff335dc825a43bd63694675d8bf07737086",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.509284,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ce5374312a945dd68604a1c2fd8057155ecaad904ba131333d5ac7629a01c887"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3637fffaebdad1ad6d6b7d9d9d863ff335dc825a43bd63694675d8bf07737086",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "浙東一帶，所給予我的混合印象，是在山的秀裏帶雄，水的清能見底，與沿途處處，桕樹紅葉的美似春花。",
      "output_sha256": "3eea9b7ce6e901169beebbdce3e63107185f0576a0993cf1821bed58cb977af9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "3eea9b7ce6e901169beebbdce3e63107185f0576a0993cf1821bed58cb977af9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "百姓都很勤儉，所以鄉下人家，家家都整潔堂皇，比起杭嘉湖的鄉村的坍敗衰落來，實在相差得很遠。",
      "output_sha256": "7b73a2a660dbb3c4960cc88b80df6d63d461a103202387b3988980dd472d46b1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "7b73a2a660dbb3c4960cc88b80df6d63d461a103202387b3988980dd472d46b1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "地勢極高，山峯綿亙，斜坡上谷底裏，竹樹最多，間有幾棵纖纖的楓樹，經霜之後，葉盡紅了，微風一動，更能顯出萬綠叢中紅一點的迷人的詩意。",
      "output_sha256": "79ab88204f05acc079d423436e7ef802313e42768ebfb67c6e3d4348d90639d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "79ab88204f05acc079d423436e7ef802313e42768ebfb67c6e3d4348d90639d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至於中國的兩大幹線，平漢和津浦，我曾經多次搭乘，其他支線如廣九、北寧、京綏等我也曾去過幾次，但從景色的變化和山水的濃淡來看，似乎沒有任何地方能比得上杭江鐵路三百餘里的一段風光；雖然我對正太鐵路尚未涉足，也不敢妄下斷言。",
      "output_sha256": "ad14a50b8bab4ba787a4771a08cdb04af02b8bd6b961669067e1cba5c9c4688c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.611018,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "63c13f812aa36ca9888830f7fcef3badff43607b192943f3e9bce0e494591c58"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ad14a50b8bab4ba787a4771a08cdb04af02b8bd6b961669067e1cba5c9c4688c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "說到人物，則金華附近的女人，皮色都是很白，相貌也都秀麗，有平湖蘇州的女人的美處，而健康高大，則又像是條頓民族的鄉間的農婦。",
      "output_sha256": "a7f023632afe25cb7174a2b54a97c2c4df58eaf74c0022046662fbac741db219",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "a7f023632afe25cb7174a2b54a97c2c4df58eaf74c0022046662fbac741db219",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "至於物產，浙東居民的主要產業是造紙和耕作，偶爾有煤礦和鐵礦，但未被開發，富饒的資源仍在地下沉睡。",
      "output_sha256": "88b4456d6407458663cdf3e3810b3df7a27db24f1fea802cba7d17fb8fe5fe78",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.504763,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "eb716998172651d128b698cd378a70e1787295bd362c9d58b94b35d052cd5526"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "88b4456d6407458663cdf3e3810b3df7a27db24f1fea802cba7d17fb8fe5fe78",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因爲多山，所以木材也多，居民之從事於燒炭燒窯者，爲數也着實不少。",
      "output_sha256": "e005fa0e0e3e1f709b97ee13242633531a65a1b2b5e8b31882873594bff935d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "e005fa0e0e3e1f709b97ee13242633531a65a1b2b5e8b31882873594bff935d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "其餘若畜牧的養豬養鴨養牛，種植的細蔗蕎麥黍稷，以及桕子玉蜀黍之類，若能改良照科學的方法做去，則金衢一帶的百姓，更可以增加富庶；可惜世亂紛紜，爲政者現在還顧不到此。",
      "output_sha256": "cf998122eca4dab3b9bbaeb1769380b4993fe7ecc20d9995e46d4a4620525ace",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "cf998122eca4dab3b9bbaeb1769380b4993fe7ecc20d9995e46d4a4620525ace",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的這一次的旅行浙東，主要原因固然是因受了杭江路局之囑託，但暗地裏卻也有一點去散散鬱悶的下意識在的。",
      "output_sha256": "64619eab906f632c53c3748fdfb31fb48f2078556594b4c05fac58ad249fadf7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "64619eab906f632c53c3748fdfb31fb48f2078556594b4c05fac58ad249fadf7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "自從上杭州隱居半年，文章不再創作，客人也少得可憐，心存戒慎，小心翼翼地默學金人，唯恐口出禍言，惹來是非。",
      "output_sha256": "35d9d5c43700f54a83d5a815df5e96b1bef4708485a8f8806bda6f15bdffa46d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.554842,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "27a48b569e2b8f955634b45cbf700379a66ac9eba30ccad329f43b31874d2306"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "35d9d5c43700f54a83d5a815df5e96b1bef4708485a8f8806bda6f15bdffa46d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但這半年的謹慎的結果，想不到竟引起了幾位杭州的文學青年的怨恨，說我架子太大，說我思想落伍，在九月秋高的那一個月裏，連接到了幾篇痛罵的文章，一封匿名的私信。",
      "output_sha256": "a35b655b7fdf0670c8f22ec9a4ff8aa3fc55cf3a5083396df005a797f57e880f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "a35b655b7fdf0670c8f22ec9a4ff8aa3fc55cf3a5083396df005a797f57e880f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "雖然我並未自視過高到想與盧騷相提並論，但當我面對窘迫的境地，前無去處，後無退路時，回頭想想，心中卻不免感到自己與那位可憐的蔣捷克相差無幾。",
      "output_sha256": "de98e71d14bfca9574e09288fc95ed76c6d9fb81c54d7a2f2ef9c0a80aacf74e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.47851,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e46ebbbe3ad97be2b81dc5592571d11ad4dc357fdacf3edc07fb0afc6b14e11c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "de98e71d14bfca9574e09288fc95ed76c6d9fb81c54d7a2f2ef9c0a80aacf74e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "當時我正打算再次前往上海或北平，尋求放浪的生活，恰巧杭江路局的事情找上我，心想這不就是落水獲救，天無絕人之路嗎？",
      "output_sha256": "e73fcb785cb179f344e0b1502fa014187ab08016875f679253886b25ab843cc3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.662429,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7bced11a563e7c51801db2ea863f2dddf3607046a20b208ca446b26e51b2b011"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e73fcb785cb179f344e0b1502fa014187ab08016875f679253886b25ab843cc3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這一段卻是不足爲外人道的我儂的私語，附寫在此，好做一個Egotistic，megalomaniac的Epilogue，以代牢騷。",
      "output_sha256": "79e327129e0a62c348b050755710c83b20da126834db9ec4fdc7acdbdd29b2d7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
